Changes in version 0.99.0

* Prepare CDSeq2 for Bioconductor review.
* Add an executable synthetic-data vignette.
* Preserve the archived 0.1.0 release and inference algorithms.
* Restore caller RNG state after explicitly seeded operations using withr.
* Split frozen DEG model storage; preserve predictions and explicit-path loading.
* Add synthetic help-page examples, inference invariants and model replay tests.
* Set the Bioconductor development R requirement to 4.6.0.
* Use the standard R package citation until the manuscript DOI is confirmed.
* Fix benchmark gene filtering for limma/DESeq2 column names and type-specific
  labels of shared DEGs; support single-cell-type label summaries.
